{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "todo-client"}, "next": {"link": "../todo_client.models/", "title": "todo_client.models"}, "title": "todo_client.client", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-todo_client.client\">\n<span id=\"todo-client-client\"></span><h1>todo_client.client<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-todo_client.client\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>The <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient\" title=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.DEFAULT_BASE_URL\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_client.client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_BASE_URL</span></span><span class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'http://localhost:8000'</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.DEFAULT_BASE_URL\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Where the client sends requests by default: the API running locally (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">uvicorn</span> <span class=\"pre\">main:app</span></code>).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient\">\n<span class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></span><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_client.client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">api_key</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">base_url</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'http://localhost:8000'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">30.0</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">http_client</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></p>\n<p>A client for the Todo API.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>api_key</strong> (<em>str</em>) \u2013 Your API key, sent as <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">X-API-Key</span></code>. The demo key is <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">demo-key</span></code>;\n<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">enterprise-demo-key</span></code> also unlocks <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.bulk_create\" title=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.bulk_create\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bulk_create()</span></code></a>.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>base_url</strong> (<em>str</em>) \u2013 Where the API runs. Defaults to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.DEFAULT_BASE_URL\" title=\"todo_client.client.DEFAULT_BASE_URL\"><code class=\"xref py py-data docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_BASE_URL</span></code></a> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">http://localhost:8000</span></code>).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<em>float</em>) \u2013 Request timeout in seconds.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>http_client</strong> (<em>Optional</em><em>[</em><em>httpx.Client</em><em>]</em>) \u2013 An existing <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">httpx.Client</span></code> to send requests with (useful in tests).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Use it as a context manager to close the connection pool when you\u2019re done:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">TodoClient</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"demo-key\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">create</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Write the docs\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.close\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">close</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.close\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Close the underlying HTTP connection pool.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.list\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">page</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">page_size</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">10</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">completed</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.list\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List one page of todos, oldest first (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GET</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos</span></code>).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>page</strong> (<em>int</em>) \u2013 Page number, starting at 1.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>page_size</strong> (<em>int</em>) \u2013 Items per page, 1 to 100.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>completed</strong> (<em>bool</em><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Only return todos with this completed state.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoPage</span></code>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.TodoPage\" title=\"todo_client.models.TodoPage\"><em>TodoPage</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.iter_all\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">iter_all</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">page_size</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">100</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">completed</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.iter_all\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Iterate over every todo, fetching pages as needed.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>page_size</strong> (<em>int</em>) \u2013 How many todos to fetch per request.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>completed</strong> (<em>bool</em><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Only yield todos with this completed state.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>Iterator</em>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.get\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_id</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get one todo (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GET</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos/{todo_id}</span></code>).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.errors/#todo_client.errors.NotFoundError\" title=\"todo_client.errors.NotFoundError\"><strong>NotFoundError</strong></a> \u2013 If there\u2019s no todo with that id.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>todo_id</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.create\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">title</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">completed</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">fields</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.create\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create a todo (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">POST</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos</span></code>).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>title</strong> (<em>str</em>) \u2013 What needs doing, 1 to 200 characters.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>completed</strong> (<em>bool</em>) \u2013 Whether it\u2019s already done.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>fields</strong> (<em>Any</em>) \u2013 Extra fields supported by newer API versions, sent as-is.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.bulk_create\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">bulk_create</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">titles</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.bulk_create\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create up to 100 todos in one request (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">POST</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos/bulk</span></code>). <strong>Enterprise plan only.</strong></p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.errors/#todo_client.errors.PermissionDeniedError\" title=\"todo_client.errors.PermissionDeniedError\"><strong>PermissionDeniedError</strong></a> \u2013 If your API key isn\u2019t an enterprise key.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>titles</strong> (<em>list</em><em>[</em><em>str</em><em>]</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>list[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.update\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">update</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_id</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"keyword-only-separator o\"><abbr title=\"Keyword-only parameters separator (PEP 3102)\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></abbr></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">title</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">completed</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.update\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Change a todo\u2019s title and/or completed state (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PATCH</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos/{todo_id}</span></code>).</p>\n<p>Arguments you leave as <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></code> are not changed.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>todo_id</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>title</strong> (<em>str</em><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>completed</strong> (<em>bool</em><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.complete\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">complete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_id</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.complete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Mark a todo as done. Shorthand for <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">update(todo_id,</span> <span class=\"pre\">completed=True)</span></code>.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>todo_id</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.models/#todo_client.models.Todo\" title=\"todo_client.models.Todo\"><em>Todo</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"todo_client.client.TodoClient.delete\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">todo_id</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete a todo (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DELETE</span> <span class=\"pre\">/todos/{todo_id}</span></code>).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../todo_client.errors/#todo_client.errors.NotFoundError\" title=\"todo_client.errors.NotFoundError\"><strong>NotFoundError</strong></a> \u2013 If there\u2019s no todo with that id.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>todo_id</strong> (<em>int</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["todo_client.models", "todo_client.models", "N", "next"], ["index", "todo-client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "todo_client.client.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">todo_client.client</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.DEFAULT_BASE_URL\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_BASE_URL</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.close\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.close()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.list\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.list()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.iter_all\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.iter_all()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.get\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.get()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.create\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.create()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.bulk_create\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.bulk_create()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.update\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.update()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.complete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.complete()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#todo_client.client.TodoClient.delete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TodoClient.delete()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "has_maths_elements": false, "current_page_name": "todo_client.client", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}